(6605089, 985577, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I can see it on the cover of a novel or even for a thriller movie poster.  The tears in the leaves really add to it.  That pop of red - my fav.</td>', 'I love this.  I can see it on the cover of a novel or even for a thriller movie poster.  The tears in the leaves really add to it.  That pop of red - my fav.', '2011-11-28 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605090, 985724, 15711, '<td valign="top">Magical!!</td>', 'Magical!!', '2011-11-28 09:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605092, 985319, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  I like the slightly out of focus tree in the BG, but it would also look cool to just see the leaves.  They have an almost 3-D appearance. ;)</td>', 'Oh I love this.  I like the slightly out of focus tree in the BG, but it would also look cool to just see the leaves.  They have an almost 3-D appearance. ;)', '2011-11-28 09:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605094, 985472, 124190, '<td valign="top">optical illusion challenge!    saw the throat first...thought....what kinda plant is that...looked up to the eye...he started to look more like a lizard (or whatever he is)....saw the surrounding plants......began to focus....now ALL I can see is his glare!!!!!    now THAT was entertaining! and kinda spooky!</td>', 'optical illusion challenge!    saw the throat first...thought....what kinda plant is that...looked up to the eye...he started to look more like a lizard (or whatever he is)....saw the surrounding plants......began to focus....now ALL I can see is his glare!!!!!    now THAT was entertaining! and kinda spooky!', '2011-11-28 09:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
