(6605098, 985783, 124190, '<td valign="top">Most captivating droplets I''ve seen in a long while!    Beautiful composition, colors, angle, lady bug position.......so alive and refreshing!  "Magazine" cover...</td>', 'Most captivating droplets I''ve seen in a long while!    Beautiful composition, colors, angle, lady bug position.......so alive and refreshing!  "Magazine" cover...', '2011-11-28 09:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
