(6606787, 985700, 125975, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous crispness of a delicate rose.  The crop adds so much to the image.</td>', 'Gorgeous crispness of a delicate rose.  The crop adds so much to the image.', '2011-11-30 19:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
