(6606838, 985791, 138545, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2011-11-30 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606851, 985783, 138545, '<td valign="top">Hang on Lady Bug!  I have never seen a rose picture like this and I love it!</td>', 'Hang on Lady Bug!  I have never seen a rose picture like this and I love it!', '2011-11-30 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606852, 985812, 138545, '<td valign="top">Enchanting!</td>', 'Enchanting!', '2011-11-30 21:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606874, 985809, 124982, '<td valign="top">Simply. Beautiful. In my top 5. Great tones and lighting. Could use a little more detail, but that''s being picky :)</td>', 'Simply. Beautiful. In my top 5. Great tones and lighting. Could use a little more detail, but that''s being picky :)', '2011-11-30 21:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606877, 985105, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the petals. Feel like there''s too much of the hand and vase in the image though...would rather the magnifying glass and flowers dominate the frame. Top 10 though!</td>', 'Lovely detail in the petals. Feel like there''s too much of the hand and vase in the image though...would rather the magnifying glass and flowers dominate the frame. Top 10 though!', '2011-11-30 21:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606878, 985752, 124982, '<td valign="top">Classic!! Just love this little guy...such a great composition, and wonderfully processed! The only minor thing is that the slope of the image is a little unsettling, could use a little straightening? Nonetheless, an 8 and in my top 5 :)</td>', 'Classic!! Just love this little guy...such a great composition, and wonderfully processed! The only minor thing is that the slope of the image is a little unsettling, could use a little straightening? Nonetheless, an 8 and in my top 5 :)', '2011-11-30 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606879, 985651, 124982, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail in this...very nice! Love the background blur too! In my Top 5!</td>', 'Incredible detail in this...very nice! Love the background blur too! In my Top 5!', '2011-11-30 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606881, 985319, 124982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but this image really appeals to me. Especially appreciate the contrast of the bright yellow leaves with the boring, drab brown wall.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but this image really appeals to me. Especially appreciate the contrast of the bright yellow leaves with the boring, drab brown wall.', '2011-11-30 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606882, 985739, 124982, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the lighting, but would love to have seen a little more detail in the mushies. Nonetheles, a top 10 for me!</td>', 'Love the composition and the lighting, but would love to have seen a little more detail in the mushies. Nonetheles, a top 10 for me!', '2011-11-30 21:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606887, 985225, 124982, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried hard to understand this image, but it''s missing me conceptually. Cant really make out what I''m looking at at...I think it''s grass and shrubs, but the way the image has been process (very flat and un-contrasty), I can''t make out any details.</td>', 'I''ve tried hard to understand this image, but it''s missing me conceptually. Cant really make out what I''m looking at at...I think it''s grass and shrubs, but the way the image has been process (very flat and un-contrasty), I can''t make out any details.', '2011-11-30 21:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606888, 985420, 124982, '<td valign="top">What''s he protesting? Composition and choice of subject are lacking -- so image comes off as very snapshot-ty.</td>', 'What''s he protesting? Composition and choice of subject are lacking -- so image comes off as very snapshot-ty.', '2011-11-30 21:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606892, 985703, 124982, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of potential..the solitude of the leaf, the motion blur..all good characteristics. But I feel the processing and composition have let you down. A tighter crop, and more detail in your subject would''ve helped significantly!</td>', 'This image has a lot of potential..the solitude of the leaf, the motion blur..all good characteristics. But I feel the processing and composition have let you down. A tighter crop, and more detail in your subject would''ve helped significantly!', '2011-11-30 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606893, 984981, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very peculiar objects, remind me strongly of mermaid purses (shark eggs).</td>', 'Very peculiar objects, remind me strongly of mermaid purses (shark eggs).', '2011-11-30 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607576, 985608, 69368, '<td valign="top">this meets the challenge perfect! I see a ribbon here! ( here is some help from my side: 10!) Very well done. Good luck</td>', 'this meets the challenge perfect! I see a ribbon here! ( here is some help from my side: 10!) Very well done. Good luck', '2011-12-01 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607577, 985578, 69368, '<td valign="top">really creatice idea! Like it very much! Good luck!</td>', 'really creatice idea! Like it very much! Good luck!', '2011-12-01 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607882, 985774, 47060, '<td valign="top">Nice image</td>', 'Nice image', '2011-12-01 16:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607910, 985689, 33672, '<td valign="top">My pick for blue! 10</td>', 'My pick for blue! 10', '2011-12-01 16:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608075, 985319, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF here and angle of the leaves.</td>', 'I really like the DOF here and angle of the leaves.', '2011-12-01 19:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608077, 985614, 66597, '<td valign="top">Pretty orchids - think it might pack more of a punch if you singled out one orchid for focus and others as background - also, none of the orchids looks quite in focus to me.</td>', 'Pretty orchids - think it might pack more of a punch if you singled out one orchid for focus and others as background - also, none of the orchids looks quite in focus to me.', '2011-12-01 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608080, 985833, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - not sure about all the negative space here.</td>', 'Very pretty - not sure about all the negative space here.', '2011-12-01 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608081, 985667, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks a little harsh on this bromeliad - nice subject, though.</td>', 'Lighting looks a little harsh on this bromeliad - nice subject, though.', '2011-12-01 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608084, 985835, 17507, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject; nice colors, and the glass-bead-looking things add an extra element of interest. Expoure is spot-on, too. But the light is too harsh. How did you light this? Looks like direct light from a single source. Dunno how much space you have, but if you can bounce the light off of something (a nice big sheet of foam core, for example), or put it through something (a thin sheet of translucent plastic (big plastic bag works)) on a frame, maybe--you get much softer light that tends to flatter floral subjects much better, and definitely avoids the hot spots that are messing with your bloom exposure. As it stands, simply cropping out the left side of the photo (which is adding nothing of interest), maybe going to a square or near-square crop, would (to me anyway) strength this photo a lot.</td>', 'Good choice of subject; nice colors, and the glass-bead-looking things add an extra element of interest. Expoure is spot-on, too. But the light is too harsh. How did you light this? Looks like direct light from a single source. Dunno how much space you have, but if you can bounce the light off of something (a nice big sheet of foam core, for example), or put it through something (a thin sheet of translucent plastic (big plastic bag works)) on a frame, maybe--you get much softer light that tends to flatter floral subjects much better, and definitely avoids the hot spots that are messing with your bloom exposure. As it stands, simply cropping out the left side of the photo (which is adding nothing of interest), maybe going to a square or near-square crop, would (to me anyway) strength this photo a lot.', '2011-12-01 19:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608085, 985105, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting take - might do well as stock photography.</td>', 'An interesting take - might do well as stock photography.', '2011-12-01 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608086, 985607, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m ambivalent about this - I like the processing, but wish there was something that drew my attention.</td>', 'I''m ambivalent about this - I like the processing, but wish there was something that drew my attention.', '2011-12-01 19:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608087, 985577, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the conception of this photo. The graininess of the b/g doesn''t add IMO, however.</td>', 'I really like the conception of this photo. The graininess of the b/g doesn''t add IMO, however.', '2011-12-01 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608088, 985738, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wish there was a shallower DOF here - b/g seems a little busy.</td>', 'Wish there was a shallower DOF here - b/g seems a little busy.', '2011-12-01 19:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608089, 985435, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this - nice conversion to b/w.</td>', 'I really like this - nice conversion to b/w.', '2011-12-01 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608090, 985709, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice conception and colors, but I think a sharper focus on the center of the flower would help.</td>', 'Nice conception and colors, but I think a sharper focus on the center of the flower would help.', '2011-12-01 19:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608093, 985703, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really love the conception behind this photo. It has an ephemeral look. I''m wishing the subject leaf stood out a little more. With a little different processing, and possibly cropping, this would be a standout!</td>', 'I really love the conception behind this photo. It has an ephemeral look. I''m wishing the subject leaf stood out a little more. With a little different processing, and possibly cropping, this would be a standout!', '2011-12-01 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608094, 985754, 66597, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. Unique and well executed.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. Unique and well executed.', '2011-12-01 19:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608095, 985578, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting - was this done in negative? I like it a lot - hope you do well.</td>', 'This is really interesting - was this done in negative? I like it a lot - hope you do well.', '2011-12-01 19:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608097, 985724, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is my choice for blue ribbon. My only 10 in the challenge. Hope you do well!</td>', 'This is my choice for blue ribbon. My only 10 in the challenge. Hope you do well!', '2011-12-01 19:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608098, 985429, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed!</td>', 'Nicely executed!', '2011-12-01 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608099, 985576, 66597, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. Nice sepia conversion.</td>', 'Really beautiful. Nice sepia conversion.', '2011-12-01 19:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608101, 985806, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept here, but looks overexposed.</td>', 'I really like the concept here, but looks overexposed.', '2011-12-01 19:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608102, 985803, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, but nothing is quite in focus...</td>', 'Beautiful colors, but nothing is quite in focus...', '2011-12-01 19:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608107, 985689, 66597, '<td valign="top">Really like this! Nice wide-angle and colors!</td>', 'Really like this! Nice wide-angle and colors!', '2011-12-01 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608112, 985827, 17507, '<td valign="top">Obviously a beautiful location, definitely meets the challenge with the abundant and varied plant life filling the frame. Good time of day to shoot, too--the light is at a lovely angle. But where is the focal point? Could you have used a wide-angle lens to make a foreground element out of a single plant? Maybe zoomed in or gotten closer to focus on one particular part of the foliage? There''s a lot to see in this image--too much, really, because there''s nowhere for my eye to settle. That significantly detracts from the impact of this photo. But it''s unquestionably a great place to shoot--I hope you come back and try some new or different techniques there!</td>', 'Obviously a beautiful location, definitely meets the challenge with the abundant and varied plant life filling the frame. Good time of day to shoot, too--the light is at a lovely angle. But where is the focal point? Could you have used a wide-angle lens to make a foreground element out of a single plant? Maybe zoomed in or gotten closer to focus on one particular part of the foliage? There''s a lot to see in this image--too much, really, because there''s nowhere for my eye to settle. That significantly detracts from the impact of this photo. But it''s unquestionably a great place to shoot--I hope you come back and try some new or different techniques there!', '2011-12-01 19:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608113, 985774, 17507, '<td valign="top">Now this is quite nice. Love the crispness of the seeds at the top and the strong contrast with the dark background. Great sense of rhythm from the branches all in parallel curves. Well done.</td>', 'Now this is quite nice. Love the crispness of the seeds at the top and the strong contrast with the dark background. Great sense of rhythm from the branches all in parallel curves. Well done.', '2011-12-01 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608114, 985754, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones and shapes; almost an abstraction. Really like this one. I wonder what a square-ish crop would have looked like, maybe taking 10% off the left and 20% off the right? Just a thought--quite pleasing in any case.</td>', 'Awesome tones and shapes; almost an abstraction. Really like this one. I wonder what a square-ish crop would have looked like, maybe taking 10% off the left and 20% off the right? Just a thought--quite pleasing in any case.', '2011-12-01 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608115, 985690, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is super duper. As a result of its being super duper, I shall now add it to my favorites without further delay</td>', 'This is super duper. As a result of its being super duper, I shall now add it to my favorites without further delay', '2011-12-01 19:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608238, 985690, 136989, '<td valign="top">I like how the light comes through and shows the veins of the leaf.  But not my favorite in terms of subject.  Unique though.</td>', 'I like how the light comes through and shows the veins of the leaf.  But not my favorite in terms of subject.  Unique though.', '2011-12-01 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608240, 985725, 136989, '<td valign="top">The blurry leaf to the left of center is a bit distracting.  Like the colors and central details.</td>', 'The blurry leaf to the left of center is a bit distracting.  Like the colors and central details.', '2011-12-01 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608242, 985752, 136989, '<td valign="top">The blur makes the shroom stand out but having it in the foreground plays with my eyes a bit.  Like the slight tilt for emphasis.</td>', 'The blur makes the shroom stand out but having it in the foreground plays with my eyes a bit.  Like the slight tilt for emphasis.', '2011-12-01 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608243, 985608, 136989, '<td valign="top">Looks like artwork for a botany text.  Nice spacing and diversity of content.</td>', 'Looks like artwork for a botany text.  Nice spacing and diversity of content.', '2011-12-01 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608245, 985829, 136989, '<td valign="top">My first thought was what is an alien doing in a botany challenge.  Then I remembered that aliens don''t exist (wink).  The cream is very hot compared to the black shadows.  I wanted to see a touch more of the green to ground the concept.</td>', 'My first thought was what is an alien doing in a botany challenge.  Then I remembered that aliens don''t exist (wink).  The cream is very hot compared to the black shadows.  I wanted to see a touch more of the green to ground the concept.', '2011-12-01 21:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608246, 985738, 136989, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is but I love the colors.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is but I love the colors.', '2011-12-01 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608248, 985796, 136989, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the colors. Hot corner in the upper right catches my eye more than I like.  Gray skies would be intense for those reds and greens.</td>', 'Love the title and the colors. Hot corner in the upper right catches my eye more than I like.  Gray skies would be intense for those reds and greens.', '2011-12-01 21:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608253, 985577, 136989, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  The color is vibrant and the leaves aren''t perfect which builds character.  The back ground is more grainy than blurry for me and is a might distracting as a result.</td>', 'I really like this one.  The color is vibrant and the leaves aren''t perfect which builds character.  The back ground is more grainy than blurry for me and is a might distracting as a result.', '2011-12-01 22:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608256, 985712, 136989, '<td valign="top">Brrr ... love the way the colors pop from the snowy background. Small nit that the bulb second from right is out of focus while those on left and right are clear.</td>', 'Brrr ... love the way the colors pop from the snowy background. Small nit that the bulb second from right is out of focus while those on left and right are clear.', '2011-12-01 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
